cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "OpticStream: Workflows for processing light-sheet microscopy and PS-OCT data for the LINC project"
abstract: >-
  OpticStream provides Prefect-based workflows and command-line tools that
  watch acquisitions and process large light-sheet microscopy (LSM) strips and
  polarization-sensitive optical coherence tomography (PS-OCT) tiles for the
  LINC project.
